[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0526","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47081","title":"PSF Requests 凭据泄漏漏洞","description":"Python Requests 库存在 URL 解析缺陷，攻击者可通过构造恶意 URL 诱导用户访问，导致 .netrc 文件中存储的凭据被泄露给第三方。该漏洞影响 Requests 2.32.4 之前的所有版本，利用条件为攻击者需诱使用户通过 Requests 库访问特制 URL，且目标环境中存在 .netrc 凭据文件。成功利用可导致敏感凭据泄露，影响系统安全。建议升级至 2.32.4 及以上版本，或通过设置 trust_env=False 禁用 .netrc 加载以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47081"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-09T18:15:24.983","updated":"2026-06-17T07:56:30.697","remediation":"升级 Python Requests 库至 2.32.4 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade requests）。如无法立即升级，在创建 Session 时设置 trust_env=False 禁用 .netrc 自动加载，或在代码中移除 .netrc 文件依赖。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/psf/requests/commit/96ba401c1296ab1dda74a2365ef36d88f7d144ef","https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/6965","https://github.com/psf/requests/security/advisories/GHSA-9hjg-9r4m-mvj7","https://requests.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/#requests.Session.trust_env","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Jun/2","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Jun/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/06/03/11","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/06/03/9","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/06/04/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/06/04/6","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-47081.md","https://github.com/psf/requests/blob/69f84847045bef7a849cc994a26fe7ba8a169e95/HISTORY.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47081.json","https://github.com/stitchdata/docs/blob/c761c223d93d11979029024d935446a84a7be75c/_changelog-files/2025/2025-06-24-bigcommerce-v1-bump-requests-to-resolve-cve-2024-47081.md","https://github.com/AgriciDaniel/claude-seo/blob/09d37c7b66ed3ca9c6efbdb765a805a6c76a8f01/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/requests/CVE-2024-47081.yml","https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/blob/6e3b4eab87bc1ec9e58d76361507e9e0be27dd4f/src/azure-cli-core/HISTORY.rst","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-47081","https://github.com/docker/docs/blob/7ca960b7a2bcb58ede70bd84d2b4202c13004e1e/content/manuals/dhi/how-to/scan.md","https://github.com/Helicone/helicone/blob/67df07b8d807a960f2e53d9ec2a9c49513ca2379/valhalla/dockerfile"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0526.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0505","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0505.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-13088","title":"QNAP QHora QuRouter 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"QHora 路由器 QuRouter 系统存在身份认证绕过漏洞（CWE-287）。攻击者在获得本地网络访问权限后，无需有效凭证即可利用该漏洞绕过身份验证机制，进而破坏系统安全性。该漏洞影响 QuRouter 2.5.0.140 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.2，危害等级中危。QNAP 已在 QuRouter 2.5.0.140 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.2,"aliases":["CVE-2024-13088"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-06-06T16:15:23.323","updated":"2026-06-17T07:01:09.040","remediation":"立即将 QHora 设备的 QuRouter 固件升级至 2.5.0.140 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议在路由器管理界面中将管理端口仅绑定到内网可信接口，并启用访问控制列表（ACL）限制仅允许受信任 IP 地址访问管理后台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-25-15","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2024/13xxx/CVE-2024-13088.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2024/13xxx/CVE-2024-13088.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2024-13088","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-13088.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-8m5f-fx5r-2p23/GHSA-8m5f-fx5r-2p23.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-13088","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-13088.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-13088","https://github.com/begumsozer/Atelier_Data_Project/blob/c180b70b99084444dad46b49963b14f4cf496528/cve_ids.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-13088.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0505.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0481","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0481.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12718","title":"Python tarfile 模块提取过滤器绕过漏洞","description":"Python tarfile 模块在处理不受信任的 tar 归档文件时存在路径遍历漏洞。当使用 TarFile.extractall() 或 TarFile.extract() 方法并设置 filter 参数为 \"data\" 或 \"tar\" 时，攻击者可通过构造特制的 tar 文件绕过提取过滤器，修改提取目录之外文件的元数据（如最后修改时间）或文件权限（chmod）。该漏洞仅影响 Python 3.12 及以上版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至修复版本或避免使用 filter 参数处理不可信 tar 文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12718"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-03T13:15:20.183","updated":"2026-06-17T07:00:20.273","remediation":"立即将 Python 升级至 3.10.18、3.11.13、3.12.11、3.13.4 或 3.14.0b3 及以上版本，这些版本已修复 tarfile 模块中 filter=\"data\" 和 filter=\"tar\" 绕过提取过滤器的路径遍历问题。如无法升级，在调用 TarFile.extractall() 和 TarFile.extract() 时避免使用 filter=\"data\" 或 filter=\"tar\"，改用 filter=\"fully_trusted\" 并手动校验路径是否在目标目录内，或使用 shutil.unpack_archive() 替代。对于 3.14+ 用户，注意默认 filter 已从\"不过滤\"变更为\"data\"，切勿依赖默认行为解压不可信 tar 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/sethmlarson/52398e33eff261329a0180ac1d54f42f","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/19de092debb3d7e832e5672cc2f7b788d35951da","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/28463dba112af719df1e8b0391c46787ad756dd9","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/3612d8f51741b11f36f8fb0494d79086bac9390a","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/4633f3f497b1ff70e4a35b6fe2c907cbe2d4cb2e","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/9c1110ef6652687d7c55f590f909720eddde965a","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/9e0ac76d96cf80b49055f6d6b9a6763fb9215c2a","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/aa9eb5f757ceff461e6e996f12c89e5d9b583b01","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/dd8f187d0746da151e0025c51680979ac5b4cfb1","https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/127987","https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/135034","https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/135037","https://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/MAXIJJCUUMCL7ATZNDVEGGHUMQMUUKLG/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12718.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12718.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12718.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/p/python3.6/python3.6.spec","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/dd62c0fd020dc65cae2b9de3ccf43d453359e843/osv/python/CVE-2024-12718.json.sha256","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-12718","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ad05f692bdc2a0af2a34a2775ccc3bbb8c03507e/2024/CVE-2024-12718.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12718.json","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/326d1eb3c211c5432d4f6357a04093f6484ab9cc/archive/2025/2025-08-08.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/e804374278d178cbcb1dcf921b09ff120cb635c2/main/python3/APKBUILD"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0481.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0489","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0489.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-22653","title":"Yasm 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Yasm 汇编器在 section.c 文件的 yasm_section_bcs_append 函数中存在空指针解引用漏洞。攻击者可通过向受影响版本提交特制的汇编源文件触发该漏洞，导致程序崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 yasm commit 9defefae 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。目前官方尚未发布正式修复补丁，建议用户谨慎处理来源不明的汇编文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-22653"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-29T15:15:29.470","updated":"2026-06-17T07:11:39.417","remediation":"建议将 yasm 更新至包含 commit 121ab15（2024年6月24日提交）的版本，该提交在 libyasm/section.c 中修复了 yasm_section_bcs_append 函数的空指针解引用问题。如无法更新，可手动应用该补丁或避免使用 yasm 处理不可信的汇编源文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/TimChan2001/03e5792b15d0a34bfaad970e37c17660","https://github.com/yasm/yasm/issues/247","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-22653.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2024/22xxx/CVE-2024-22653.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-22653.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-22653","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2024/22xxx/CVE-2024-22653.json","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/yasm/yasm/CVE-2024-22653.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-22653.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-22653.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-22653-yasm-commit-9defefae-was-discovered-1771410935000.md","https://github.com/foundriesio/docs/blob/3727e8eed2efbebec87b04f63db7cb011bf62a6c/release-notes/v96/changelog_v96.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0489.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0490","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-23337","title":"jqlang jq 整数溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"jq 是一款命令行 JSON 处理器，其 jv.c 文件中的 jvp_array_write 函数存在有符号整数溢出漏洞。当攻击者使用索引值 2147483647（有符号整数上限）向数组赋值时，会触发整数溢出，导致程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 jq 1.7.1 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，但需要目标系统运行 jq 处理特制的 JSON 输入。官方已在 commit de21386681c0df0104a99d9d09db23a9b2a78b1e 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-23337"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-21T15:16:03.920","updated":"2026-06-17T07:12:37.490","remediation":"升级 jq 至 1.8.0 及以上版本（该版本限制数组/对象最大元素数为 536870912，彻底修复整数溢出问题）；如无法升级，可通过打补丁方式应用 commit de21386681c0df0104a99d9d09db23a9b2a78b1e；临时缓解措施：避免使用 jq 处理包含超大索引（接近 2147483647）的不可信 JSON 输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/jqlang/jq/commit/de21386681c0df0104a99d9d09db23a9b2a78b1e","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/issues/3262","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/security/advisories/GHSA-2q6r-344g-cx46","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-23337.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2024/23xxx/CVE-2024-23337.json","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/blob/2d410d6d86be7f685ad28e5cffac0248aa47664c/NEWS.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-23337.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-23337","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2024/23xxx/CVE-2024-23337.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/e804374278d178cbcb1dcf921b09ff120cb635c2/main/jq/APKBUILD","https://github.com/hashicorp/hcp/blob/22914bf04188992bd99f6dea82da226d9204f62b/.release/security-scan.hcl","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/jq/jq/CVE-2024-23337.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-23337.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0490.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0530","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0530.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47619","title":"OneIdentity syslog-ng TLS证书通配符匹配绕过漏洞","description":"syslog-ng 日志守护进程的 TLS 证书主机名验证功能存在通配符匹配过于宽松的安全漏洞。`tls_wildcard_match()` 函数错误地允许了 `foo.*.bar` 这类不合规的通配符证书模式，同时还能匹配 `foo.a*c.bar` 等部分通配符，这违反了 TLS 证书验证标准。攻击者可通过中间人攻击利用此缺陷，使用精心构造的恶意证书绕过主机名验证，导致 TLS 连接被劫持，破坏通信完整性。该漏洞影响 syslog-ng 4.8.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 4.8.2 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47619"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-07T16:15:21.980","updated":"2026-06-17T07:57:24.830","remediation":"立即升级 syslog-ng 至 4.8.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 TLS 证书通配符匹配过于宽松的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 TLS 配置中禁用通配符证书匹配，或使用明确的非通配符证书替代。对于使用 syslog-ng 的 Linux 发行版，请关注各发行商的安全更新推送。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/syslog-ng/syslog-ng/blob/b0ccc8952d333fbc2d97e51fddc0b569a15e7a7d/lib/transport/tls-verifier.c#L78-L110","https://github.com/syslog-ng/syslog-ng/commit/dadfdbecde5bfe710b0a6ee5699f96926b3f9006","https://github.com/syslog-ng/syslog-ng/releases/tag/syslog-ng-4.8.2","https://github.com/syslog-ng/syslog-ng/security/advisories/GHSA-xr54-gx74-fghg","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00034.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-47619.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47619.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-47619","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47619.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-47619.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2024-47619-2025-05-28-0905","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47619.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-47619.html","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-47619","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/8c0b8a4513f8428fb95d9bc26f586638701c0668/references/contrib1-CVE-2024-47619-2025-05-28-0905"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0530.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0565","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0565.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56406","title":"Perl Perl tr运算符堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Perl 编程语言中的 `tr`（音译）运算符在处理左侧非 ASCII 字节时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 `tr` 运算符的左操作数包含非 ASCII 字节时，`S_do_trans_invmap` 函数中的目标指针 `d` 会发生越界写入，导致堆内存损坏。攻击者可通过构造特制的 Perl 脚本（如 `perl -e '$_ = \"\\x{FF}\" x 1000000; tr/\\xFF/\\x{100}/;'`）触发该漏洞，在缺乏足够内存安全防护的平台上可能导致拒绝服务或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Perl 5.34、5.36、5.38、5.40 及 5.33.1 至 5.41.10 的开发版本，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高。利用该漏洞需要本地执行恶意 Perl 脚本的能力，无需特殊权限或用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56406"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-13T14:15:14.527","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:08.977","remediation":"升级 Perl 至修复版本：5.40.x 用户升级到 5.40.2，5.38.x 用户升级到 5.38.4，5.34.x 和 5.36.x 用户升级到对应发行版的最新安全补丁版本。如无法立即升级，可应用上游 commit 87f42aa0e0096e9a346c9672aa3a0bd3bef8c1dd 的补丁（https://github.com/Perl/perl5/commit/87f42aa0e0096e9a346c9672aa3a0bd3bef8c1dd.patch）手动修补源码后重新编译。Linux 发行版用户应通过系统包管理器安装安全更新（如 apt upgrade perl / yum update perl）。临时缓解措施：避免在 `tr` 运算符左侧使用非 ASCII 字节序列处理不可信输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Perl/perl5/commit/87f42aa0e0096e9a346c9672aa3a0bd3bef8c1dd.patch","https://metacpan.org/release/SHAY/perl-5.38.4/changes","https://metacpan.org/release/SHAY/perl-5.40.2/changes","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/13/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/13/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/13/5","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56406.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56406.json","https://github.com/manwar/theweeklychallenge/blob/b80269de5ec1a2920fe576a532db22fcedb45a71/content/blog/cve-2024-56406.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56406.json","https://github.com/ekala-project/corepkgs/blob/d42eedf53274274d7bb9666071a8eecaa3dae5a0/pkgs-many/perl/CVE-2024-56406.patch","https://github.com/Perl/perl5/blob/d0f7d8eef2afa1167f036c6ddfe1fca566f3e922/pod/perl5402delta.pod","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-56406","https://github.com/openbsd/src/blob/7df8bae8aea92b7558995237fccbbb695cae1615/gnu/usr.bin/perl/pod/perl5384delta.pod","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56406.json","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/326d1eb3c211c5432d4f6357a04093f6484ab9cc/archive/2025/2025-04-16.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0565.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0551","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0551.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52981","title":"Elastic Elasticsearch 堆栈溢出漏洞","description":"Elasticsearch 在处理 Well-Known Text（WKT）格式的字符串时存在堆栈溢出漏洞。当解析包含嵌套 GeometryCollection 对象的特制 WKT 字符串时，递归深度过大导致堆栈溢出，造成服务拒绝。该漏洞需要高权限才能利用，攻击者可通过向 Elasticsearch 发送构造的 WKT 查询触发此问题，影响 Elasticsearch 服务的可用性。Elasticsearch 官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52981"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-08T17:15:35.187","updated":"2026-06-17T08:07:57.787","remediation":"建议立即升级 Elasticsearch 至 7.17.24 或 8.15.1 及以上版本，官方已发布安全更新修复了 WKT 解析中嵌套 GeometryCollection 对象导致的栈溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层限制 WKT 输入字符串的递归深度，或通过反向代理/防火墙限制仅受信用户访问 Elasticsearch 的 HTTP API 端口（默认 9200），降低高权限攻击者触发漏洞的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://discuss.elastic.co/t/elasticsearch-7-17-24-and-8-15-1-security-update-esa-2024-37/376924","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52981.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52981.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-52981.json","https://github.com/trailofbits/publications/blob/68408ccfe7600935cea71dbf7b5c930f7ea3a8d0/README.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-52981","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52981.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/org.elasticsearch/elasticsearch/CVE-2024-52981.yml","https://github.com/IHTSDO/snowstorm/blob/a11bac7e98c045d8b40770eb705347fd8924ed1d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/sscarduzio/elasticsearch-readonlyrest-plugin/blob/e9654904cf1ce638b081af4c5ef81522d6ca64cd/suppressions_cve.xml","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-52981.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0551.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0551.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0550","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0550.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52980","title":"Elastic Elasticsearch 不受控制的资源消耗漏洞","description":"Elasticsearch 的 PatternBank 类中的 innerForbidCircularReferences 函数存在不受控制的资源消耗漏洞（CWE-400）。具有 read_pipeline Elasticsearch 集群权限的恶意用户可通过构造特制的递归查询请求，触发深度递归调用，导致 Elasticsearch 节点因资源耗尽而崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Elasticsearch 多个版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等。建议用户升级至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52980"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-08T17:15:34.880","updated":"2026-06-17T08:07:57.677","remediation":"升级 Elasticsearch 至 8.15.1 或更高版本。对于无法立即升级的环境，应从不可信用户的 Elasticsearch 集群角色中移除 read_pipeline 权限，阻止攻击者利用 PatternBank 类的递归缺陷触发节点崩溃。同时建议在集群层面配置线程池和断路器参数（如 circuit_breaker.request.limit），限制递归操作资源消耗。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://discuss.elastic.co/t/elasticsearch-8-15-1-security-update-esa-2024-34/376919","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52980.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52980.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-52980.json","https://github.com/trailofbits/publications/blob/68408ccfe7600935cea71dbf7b5c930f7ea3a8d0/README.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-52980","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52980.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/org.elasticsearch/elasticsearch/CVE-2024-52980.yml","https://github.com/sscarduzio/elasticsearch-readonlyrest-plugin/blob/e9654904cf1ce638b081af4c5ef81522d6ca64cd/suppressions_cve.xml","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-52980.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-52980.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0550.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0470","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11235","title":"PHP 请求关闭过程释放后重用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHP 8.3.19 之前版本及 8.4.5 之前版本中存在 Use-After-Free 漏洞，该漏洞源于 php_request_shutdown 过程中引用计数处理不当。当 __set 方法或 ??= 运算符与异常处理交织执行时，可触发已释放内存的重复使用。若攻击者能够控制内存布局并向目标 PHP 应用发送特制的恶意输入，则可利用该漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响大量使用受影响 PHP 版本构建的 Web 应用，CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重。建议用户升级至 PHP 8.3.19 或 8.4.5 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11235"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-04T18:15:48.020","updated":"2026-06-17T06:57:21.650","remediation":"立即将 PHP 升级至 8.3.19 或 8.4.5 及以上版本。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.3.* < 8.3.19 和 8.4.* < 8.4.5，由异常处理器与 __set 或 ??= 运算符交互导致堆释放后使用（Use-After-Free），可被利用实现远程代码执行。PHP 8.2 及更早版本不受影响。如无法立即升级，应避免在 __set 方法中触发异常，或严格过滤用户可控输入以防止内存布局操控。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-rwp7-7vc6-8477","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2024/CVE-2024-11235.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11235.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-11235","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11235.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-11235.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-11235.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-11235.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-11235-reference-counting-in-php-request-s-1771409119000.md","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-11235","https://github.com/FreshTomato-Project/freshtomato-arm/blob/240e615c5db411a540cbeae405c9220098c680ae/release/src-rt-6.x.4708/router/php/NEWS"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0534","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48615","title":"libarchive bsdtar 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"libarchive 3.7.6 及之前版本中的 bsdtar 程序在处理 tar 格式文件的 PAX 扩展头部时，存在空指针解引用漏洞。具体位于 `archive_read_support_format_tar.c` 文件的 `header_pax_extension` 函数中，当解析特制的 PAX 扩展属性时，程序未对指针进行有效性检查便直接解引用，导致崩溃。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含恶意 PAX 扩展头部的 tar 文件触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证及用户交互，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48615"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-28T15:15:45.023","updated":"2026-06-17T07:58:37.273","remediation":"立即升级 libarchive 至 3.7.7 及以上版本（最新稳定版为 3.8.8）。该漏洞存在于 3.7.6 及更早版本的 `header_pax_extension` 函数中，处理特制 PAX 头部时触发空指针解引用导致 bsdtar 崩溃。可通过 `apt upgrade libarchive`（Debian/Ubuntu）或 `yum update libarchive`（RHEL/CentOS）更新。如无法立即升级，避免使用 bsdtar 处理不可信的 tar 归档文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/88Sanghy88/crash-test","https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive/releases/download/v3.7.6/libarchive-3.7.6.tar.gz","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-48615.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48615.json","https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/blob/505f834d7881c25a6ae1c5eb24fe6c28d896543c/docs/changelogs/v25.4.6.67-stable.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-48615.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-48615","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-48615.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-48615.json","https://github.com/chef/chef-web-docs/blob/58e8a50d4a498854f2c6fb4e0fdf19307acacf48/content/release_notes/workstation.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-48615.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-57fm-4q7w-88cr/GHSA-57fm-4q7w-88cr.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0534.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0484","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0484.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12905","title":"tar-fs tar文件解压路径遍历与任意文件写入漏洞","description":"tar-fs 包中的 index.js 文件存在不安全的符号链接解析与路径遍历漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意的 tar 压缩包，在解压过程中利用符号链接跳转到目标目录之外，实现任意文件写入或覆盖。该漏洞影响 tar-fs 1.16.4 之前、2.1.2 之前以及 3.0.8 之前的多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。用户需升级至修复版本以防范此风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12905"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:53.250","updated":"2026-06-17T07:00:44.367","remediation":"将 `tar-fs` 升级到修复版本：1.x 分支升级到 ≥1.16.4，2.x 分支升级到 ≥2.1.2，3.x 分支升级到 ≥3.0.8。如暂时无法升级，在解压不可信 tar 文件前对文件路径进行校验，拒绝包含 `../` 及符号链接指向目标目录之外的条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/mafintosh/tar-fs/commit/a1dd7e7c7f4b4a8bd2ab60f513baca573b44e2ed","https://www.seal.security/blog/a-link-to-the-past-uncovering-a-new-vulnerability-in-tar-fs","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/06/msg00012.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52268","https://github.com/theMcSam/CVE-2024-12905-PoC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12905.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-12905.json","https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/blob/943548a7b221d2e297ed3d9f9054801ff17b1fd5/cli/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/aaad87cd4808a501b9c27168b0278466591227b9/data/2024/CVE-2024-12905-theMcSam_CVE-2024-12905-PoC.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2024/CVE-2024-12905/exploit.py","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-12905.rules","https://github.com/vercel/vercel/blob/fabae940acf33ca050f0767d3d5dadc61fcffe32/packages/cli/src/commands/init/init.ts","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12905.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/tar-fs/CVE-2024-12905.yml","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/y/yarnpkg/yarnpkg.spec"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0484.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0504","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-40635","title":"containerd 用户ID处理整数溢出漏洞","description":"containerd 容器运行时的用户 ID 处理存在整数溢出漏洞，当容器配置的 User 字段设置为超过 32 位有符号整数最大值（即 2147483647）的 UID:GID 时，整数溢出导致容器进程最终以 root 用户（UID 0）运行。该漏洞影响 containerd 1.6.38、1.7.27 及 2.0.4 之前的所有版本，可导致依赖非 root 用户运行容器的安全策略失效，产生意外提权风险。攻击者可通过加载特制镜像或调用相关 API 触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2024-40635"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-17T22:15:13.150","updated":"2026-06-17T07:46:12.817","remediation":"立即将 containerd 升级至 1.6.38、1.7.27 或 2.0.4 及以上版本以修复整数溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，确保仅使用受信任的容器镜像，并限制非受信用户的镜像导入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/containerd/containerd/commit/05044ec0a9a75232cad458027ca83437aae3f4da","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/commit/1a43cb6a1035441f9aca8f5666a9b3ef9e70ab20","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/commit/cf158e884cfe4812a6c371b59e4ea9bc4c46e51a","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/security/advisories/GHSA-265r-hfxg-fhmg","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00005.html","https://github.com/yen5004/CVE-2024-40635_POC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-40635.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-40635.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/ad81b017c65b0fbc4ac39e9916807e69e5366a82/data/2024/CVE-2024-40635-yen5004_CVE-2024-40635_POC.md","https://github.com/ctrsploit/ctrsploit/blob/c7e0cebeec8ada5c08ff7abba44dcfc2ffceac9c/vul/cve-2024-40635/vul.go","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2024/CVE-2024-40635/README.md","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/blob/e05f673e2743e482e47128aeb8c5a87bde7ca612/docs/security/THREAT_MODEL.md","https://github.com/rancher/rancher/blob/78e5a036e183f6eee00a390ab87b8bc8a667a2a8/hack/airgap/go.mod","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2024-40635-2025-05-04-2105","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-40635.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-40635"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0504.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0560","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0560.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55549","title":"libxslt libxslt 释放后使用漏洞","description":"libxslt 1.1.43 之前版本中的 xsltGetInheritedNsList 函数存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。该漏洞源于在处理 XSLT 转换过程中排除结果命名空间前缀时，函数对已释放的内存对象进行了错误引用，导致程序在后续操作中访问已被释放的内存区域。攻击者可通过向受影响应用提交特制的 XSLT 样式表触发该漏洞，造成程序崩溃或潜在的内存数据篡改，影响系统完整性和可用性。该漏洞需本地访问且攻击复杂度较高，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55549"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-14T02:15:15.333","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:13.393","remediation":"立即将 libxslt 升级至 1.1.43 及以上版本（1.1.43 于 2025 年 3 月 12 日发布，已修复该释放后使用问题）。Debian 用户可运行 `apt-get update && apt-get install --only-upgrade libxslt1.1` 安装安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在应用层禁用 XSLT 转换功能或使用 AppArmor/SELinux 策略限制 libxslt 进程权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxslt/-/issues/127","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00015.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-55549.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55549.json","https://github.com/sparklemotion/nokogiri/blob/80a20e46d767990d84e28a2b8e5c536022e222d1/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-55549.json","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/Jackalope/blob/a11da5062037d9c957823ddbb0bb555a5217ca3e/examples/libxslt/README.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-55549","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55549.json","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/44e5061a641d03874912e76bae1fc33d2e0d6cf1/gems/nokogiri/GHSA-mrxw-mxhj-p664.yml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-55549.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-55549-2025-11-03-1430"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0560.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0522","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0522.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45782","title":"GNU GRUB2 HFS 文件系统堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 HFS 文件系统驱动在处理挂载操作时，未对用户提供的卷标名称长度进行有效校验，直接调用 `strcpy()` 将卷标复制到固定大小的堆缓冲区中，导致堆越界写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过挂载特制的 HFS 文件系统卷触发该漏洞，破坏 GRUB 的敏感数据完整性，最终绕过安全启动（Secure Boot）保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 GRUB2 的系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45782"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T17:15:12.900","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41.673","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至 2.12 以上版本（含已合入补丁的构建），或应用上游补丁 `417547c10410b714e43f08f74137c24015f8f4c3`，将 `grub-core/fs/hfs.c:382` 处的 `grub_strcpy()` 替换为 `grub_strlcpy()` 以限制拷贝长度。各发行版用户安装对应安全更新：RHEL 用户关注 RHSA 公告，Debian/Ubuntu 用户通过 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc grub-efi` 更新，更新后执行 `grub-install` 重新安装引导器。如无法立即更新，限制本地攻击者访问系统引导分区并启用 UEFI Secure Boot 配合 SBAT 策略阻止未签名 GRUB 加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45782","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345858","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45782.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45782.nopatch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/b8117fffa9486975f050b7b07cfad353ee71453e/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45782.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45782","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45782.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45782.md","https://github.com/seapath/meta-seapath/blob/479229566d9de44367de66249dba8ed29de7b8ff/recipes-bsp/grub/files/CVE-2024-45782_CVE-2024-56737.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45782.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0522.toml"}]